OL,3,GNEWSAKarl Bushby completes 28-year
OL,4,Aglobal trek from Chile to Hull
OL,5,
OL,6,FKarl Bushby has returned to his
OL,7,Fchildhood home in Hull after leaving
OL,8,FChile in November 1998 with the aim of
OL,9,Fwalking an unbroken path back to his
OL,10,Froots
OL,12,FTo date, he has crossed four
OL,13,Fcontinents, swum the English Channel
OL,14,Fand walked more than 31,000 miles
OL,15,F(58,000km)
OL,17,FFamily, friends and supporters have
OL,18,Fbeen waiting for him at the finish line
OL,20,FHe crossed the Humber Bridge on Sunday
OL,21,Fand was 'overwhelmed' with the
OL,22,Freception
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
