OL,3,GNEWSAKarl Bushby completes 28-year
OL,4,Aglobal trek from Chile to Hull
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe expedition has been mainly
OL,7,Fself-funded. However, sponsors have
OL,8,Fjoined along the way, including a
OL,9,FUS-based documentary firm
OL,11,FKarl has been sent a letter of
OL,12,Fcongratulations from Prime Minister
OL,13,FAndy Burnham, who has praised his
OL,14,Fdetermination and self belief
OL,16,FBiju Kurian has travelled from the US
OL,17,Fto be here today. Biju says he hosted
OL,18,FKarl for nine days when he travelled
OL,19,Finto Oklahoma in 2014
